docs/build-log/artifacts/track-r/corpus.jsonl
docs/build-log/artifacts/track-r/corpus-adapter.lock.json
docs/build-log/artifacts/track-r/adapter-goldens.jsonl
docs/build-log/artifacts/track-r/agent-cache/
docs/build-log/artifacts/track-r/requests/
# Phase 1b/1c run outputs. The evidence JSONLs carry full retrieved event text
# (third-party bodies); the provenance reports are large per-question dumps.
# Only the derived `track_r_phase1_retrieval_summary.json` alongside is committed.
docs/build-log/artifacts/track-r/phase1/
docs/build-log/artifacts/track-r/phase1d/
# Phase 1r retrieval-arm run outputs, same rule: the evidence JSONLs carry full
# retrieved event text and the provenance reports are large per-question dumps.
# Only the derived `track_r_phase1r_retrieval_arms.json` alongside is committed.
docs/build-log/artifacts/track-r/phase1r/

# Exact-channel magnitude re-measurement (2026-07-30). Per-question outputs and
# server logs carry third-party event bodies; only the derived
# `track_r_packadj_exact_magnitude.json` alongside is committed.
docs/build-log/artifacts/track-r/packadj2/
docs/build-log/artifacts/rung7-packing-reader-gate/packadj2/chat-*-evidence.jsonl
# Phase 1e combined-build (retrieval + packing) run outputs, same rule.
# Only the derived `track_r_phase1e_combined_fixes.json` alongside is committed.
docs/build-log/artifacts/track-r/phase1e/
# W1 render-loss run outputs, same rule. Only the derived
# `track_r_phase1w_render_loss.json` alongside is committed.
docs/build-log/artifacts/track-r/phase1w/
benchmarks/data/track_r_repo_memory_golden.jsonl
benchmarks/data/track_r_repo_memory_spotcheck.jsonl
!benchmarks/data/track_r_repo_memory_golden.lock.json
# Chat-lane packing non-regression run outputs: the two evidence JSONLs are
# 4.2 MB each of retrieved LongMemEval session text, and the derived
# `chat-lane-nonregression.json` (committed) already carries the comparison,
# including the packed-context identity check computed from them.
docs/build-log/artifacts/rung7-packing-reader-gate/phase1d/*-evidence.jsonl
docs/build-log/artifacts/rung7-packing-reader-gate/phase1d/*.log
docs/build-log/artifacts/rung7-packing-reader-gate/phase1w/*-evidence.jsonl
docs/build-log/artifacts/rung7-packing-reader-gate/phase1w/*.log

# GitHub lane (docs/build-log/2026-07-31-github-lane-bar-and-privacy.md §5.1).
# Bodies stay out of the repo: four of the five source repositories are private.
# Only the lock is committed.
benchmarks/data/github_lane_golden.jsonl
benchmarks/data/github_lane_corpus.jsonl
!benchmarks/data/github_lane_golden.lock.json

# W0.1 Track R PARAPHRASE variant. Same rule as the original bank: the reply
# cache, request batches, run outputs and mined golden bodies carry third-party
# event text; only the lock and the derived leakage report are committed.
docs/build-log/artifacts/track-r-paraphrase/agent-cache/
docs/build-log/artifacts/track-r-paraphrase/requests/
docs/build-log/artifacts/track-r-paraphrase/run/
# Reader-QA reports carry the golden bank's questions and gold answers
# verbatim in per_question, so they are bodies, not results. The scored
# comparison artifact (code_lane_reader_compare.py) is committed instead.
docs/build-log/artifacts/track-r-paraphrase/reader/
docs/build-log/artifacts/code-lane-reader/*/
benchmarks/data/track_r_paraphrase_golden.jsonl
benchmarks/data/track_r_paraphrase_spotcheck.jsonl
!benchmarks/data/track_r_paraphrase_golden.lock.json
docs/build-log/artifacts/track-r-floor/agent-cache/
docs/build-log/artifacts/track-r-floor/requests/
docs/build-log/artifacts/track-r-paraphrase/leakage-paraphrase.json
